  "body": "For example, if a mouse pointer moves from an element in a shadow tree to its shadow host, a \"mouseover\" event should not be dispatched on the shadow host. The current spec allows a non-empty event path in this case.\n\nThis is an unintentional bug, which should be fixed.\nSee also https://github.com/w3c/webcomponents/issues/577.\n",
